    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/7788ec5a827d545b0dd2d485ffe3f3af.poster.avif?t=1749633819\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/7788ec5a827d545b0dd2d485ffe3f3af.webm?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to Planet Royale, the galaxy's premiere planet-hopping gameshow! Join Beeble the broadcast-bot, and other daring, determined and downright deranged competitors on planets scheduled for destruction by the Galactic Council, as you loot, shoot and blast your way to becoming the Galaxy's boldest warrior.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/9015af74a15d5f67b1f2214e7aae5f59.poster.avif?t=1749633819\" width=600 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/9015af74a15d5f67b1f2214e7aae5f59.webm?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/9015af74a15d5f67b1f2214e7aae5f59.mp4?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Heroes come in all shapes and sizes! Will you be backing Rusty, the second generation personal security-bot? Or perhaps Flora, the sentient forest sentinel, is more your speed. From the renegade starship pilot, Cosmo, to the Galactic Council's very own Maximillian 'Mutton-chops' McGee, there are endless encounters to be had against fresh foes in space! Get an edge on the competition by customizing your champion with unique skills, outfits and power-ups before landing on procedurally generated planets in this frantic, rootin' tootin' laser-shootin' Battle Royale.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/31c50d6ad61fca5736709c2a7758a8fe.poster.avif?t=1749633819\" width=600 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/31c50d6ad61fca5736709c2a7758a8fe.webm?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/31c50d6ad61fca5736709c2a7758a8fe.mp4?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Rumblings have been heard across all emergency frequencies that someone, or someTHING, is sweeping across the outer planets leaving devastation in its wake. Sightings of feral, toothsome maws and crackling energy beams suggest that, after nearly a century of galactic peace, the 'Green Tide' have returned from their exile, hungry for revenge on the Galactic Council that cast them out. <br>Who better to drive back the waves of ravenous foes then, than Planet Royale's very own cast of heroes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/78f3eb5defc270f467fd4263a9044f36.avif?t=1749633819\" width=600 height=165 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Compete online with up to 20 players in a battle for survival and glory<br></li><li> Escape the planet-mining laser as it rips up the ground beneath your feet<br></li><li> Defeat hoards of invasive, alien monsters across a PvE campaign<br></li><li> With procedurally-generated worlds containing unique and creative weapon designs, no two games are ever alike.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/a4a9dd8841ff50175ec75f8401e49ec8.avif?t=1749633819\" width=640 height=640 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/7788ec5a827d545b0dd2d485ffe3f3af.poster.avif?t=1749633819\" width=600 height=600 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/7788ec5a827d545b0dd2d485ffe3f3af.webm?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Welcome to Planet Royale, the galaxy's premiere planet-hopping gameshow! Join Beeble the broadcast-bot, and other daring, determined and downright deranged competitors on planets scheduled for destruction by the Galactic Council, as you loot, shoot and blast your way to becoming the Galaxy's boldest warrior.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/9015af74a15d5f67b1f2214e7aae5f59.poster.avif?t=1749633819\" width=600 height=436 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/9015af74a15d5f67b1f2214e7aae5f59.webm?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/9015af74a15d5f67b1f2214e7aae5f59.mp4?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Heroes come in all shapes and sizes! Will you be backing Rusty, the second generation personal security-bot? Or perhaps Flora, the sentient forest sentinel, is more your speed. From the renegade starship pilot, Cosmo, to the Galactic Council's very own Maximillian 'Mutton-chops' McGee, there are endless encounters to be had against fresh foes in space! Get an edge on the competition by customizing your champion with unique skills, outfits and power-ups before landing on procedurally generated planets in this frantic, rootin' tootin' laser-shootin' Battle Royale.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/31c50d6ad61fca5736709c2a7758a8fe.poster.avif?t=1749633819\" width=600 height=470 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/31c50d6ad61fca5736709c2a7758a8fe.webm?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/31c50d6ad61fca5736709c2a7758a8fe.mp4?t=1749633819\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Rumblings have been heard across all emergency frequencies that someone, or someTHING, is sweeping across the outer planets leaving devastation in its wake. Sightings of feral, toothsome maws and crackling energy beams suggest that, after nearly a century of galactic peace, the 'Green Tide' have returned from their exile, hungry for revenge on the Galactic Council that cast them out. <br>Who better to drive back the waves of ravenous foes then, than Planet Royale's very own cast of heroes!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/78f3eb5defc270f467fd4263a9044f36.avif?t=1749633819\" width=600 height=165 /></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Compete online with up to 20 players in a battle for survival and glory<br></li><li> Escape the planet-mining laser as it rips up the ground beneath your feet<br></li><li> Defeat hoards of invasive, alien monsters across a PvE campaign<br></li><li> With procedurally-generated worlds containing unique and creative weapon designs, no two games are ever alike.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2850720/extras/a4a9dd8841ff50175ec75f8401e49ec8.avif?t=1749633819\" width=640 height=640 /></span>",
